#: includes/modules.php:39 includes/privacy.php:20
#: modules/thumbnail/bulk.php:161 modules/thumbnail/module.php:19
#: modules/thumbnail/module.php:335
msgid "Thumbnail generator"
msgstr "Pembuat thumbnail"

#: includes/modules.php:40
msgid ""
"Make a cover picture for a post from its title and description, and use it "
"as the featured image."
msgstr ""
"Buat gambar sampul untuk pos dari judul dan deskripsinya, lalu pakai sebagai "
"gambar unggulan."

#: includes/modules.php:43
msgid "Light security hardening"
msgstr "Pengerasan keamanan ringan"

#: includes/modules.php:44
msgid ""
"Safe switches that close common gaps (see Settings > WPlus Security once it "
"is on)."
msgstr ""
"Saklar aman untuk menutup celah umum (lihat Pengaturan > WPlus Security "
"setelah dinyalakan)."

#: includes/privacy.php:19
msgid ""
"The texts below say what WPlus Addons does with data. Copy what is true for "
"your site into your privacy policy."
msgstr ""
"Teks di bawah ini menjelaskan apa yang dilakukan WPlus Addons dengan data. "
"Salin yang berlaku untuk situs Anda ke kebijakan privasi."

#: includes/privacy.php:21
msgid ""
"The cover pictures are drawn in the browser of the person who makes them and "
"saved in the Media Library of this site. No text or picture is sent to "
"another site, and no visitor data is collected. The fonts are part of the "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"Gambar sampul dibuat di browser orang yang membuatnya dan disimpan di "
"Pustaka Media situs ini. Tidak ada teks atau gambar yang dikirim ke situs "
"lain, dan tidak ada data pengunjung yang dikumpulkan. Font adalah bagian "
"dari plugin."

#: includes/privacy.php:22
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan"

#: includes/privacy.php:23
msgid ""
"When WordPress checks for updates, the plugin asks GitHub for the latest "
"version. GitHub receives the address of this site's server and the version "
"of the plugin, and nothing about your visitors or users."
msgstr ""
"Saat WordPress memeriksa pembaruan, plugin menanyakan versi terbaru ke "
"GitHub. GitHub menerima alamat server situs ini dan versi plugin, dan tidak "
"ada apa pun tentang pengunjung atau pengguna Anda."

#: includes/privacy.php:24 modules/shield/settings.php:127
msgid "Login attempts"
msgstr "Percobaan login"

#: includes/privacy.php:25
msgid ""
"If the limit on failed logins is on, the plugin keeps the IP address of "
"every address with failed logins, and how many, for a short time (until the "
"counting time is over, 15 minutes to start with, and at most 200 addresses) "
"so that an address that tries too often can be locked. They are removed when "
"that time is over, when an administrator presses Unlock, and when the plugin "
"is deleted. No user name or password is kept."
msgstr ""
"Jika batas login gagal menyala, plugin menyimpan alamat IP dari setiap "
"alamat dengan login gagal, dan jumlahnya, untuk waktu singkat (sampai waktu "
"hitung berakhir, 15 menit pada awalnya, dan paling banyak 200 alamat) agar "
"alamat yang terlalu sering mencoba bisa dikunci. Data itu dihapus saat "
"waktunya habis, saat administrator menekan Buka kunci, dan saat plugin "
"dihapus. Nama pengguna dan kata sandi tidak disimpan."

#: includes/settings.php:47 includes/settings.php:58
msgid "WPlus Addons"
msgstr "WPlus Addons"

#: includes/settings.php:60 modules/shield/health.php:458
msgid "Checked just now."
msgstr "Baru saja diperiksa."

#: includes/settings.php:74
msgid "Switched on"
msgstr "Menyala"

#: includes/updater.php:260
msgid ""
"Small, optional tools for WPlus UI and any WordPress site. Each tool can be "
"switched off."
msgstr ""
"Alat kecil dan opsional untuk WPlus UI dan situs WordPress mana pun. Setiap "
"alat bisa dimatikan."

#: includes/updater.php:288
msgid ""
"The downloaded plugin file does not match its checksum, so it was not "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Berkas plugin yang diunduh tidak cocok dengan checksum-nya, jadi tidak "
"dipasang."

#: includes/updater.php:299 modules/shield/health.php:145
#: modules/shield/login-limit.php:240
msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "Anda tidak diizinkan melakukan ini."

#: includes/updater.php:319
msgid "Update checks are turned off for this site."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan pembaruan dimatikan untuk situs ini."

#. translators: %s: version number
#: includes/updater.php:326
#, php-format
msgid "Version %s is available"
msgstr "Versi %s tersedia"

#. translators: %s: version number
#: includes/updater.php:328
#, php-format
msgid "You have version %s."
msgstr "Anda memakai versi %s."

#. translators: %s: version number
#: includes/updater.php:331
#, php-format
msgid "You have the latest version (%s)"
msgstr "Anda memakai versi terbaru (%s)"

#. translators: %s: version number
#: includes/updater.php:334
#, php-format
msgid "Version %s. The latest version could not be checked right now."
msgstr "Versi %s. Versi terbaru tidak bisa diperiksa saat ini."

#: includes/updater.php:339
msgid "Update now"
msgstr "Perbarui sekarang"

#: includes/updater.php:341
msgid "Check now"
msgstr "Periksa sekarang"

#. translators: %s: how long ago, for example "5 minutes"
#: includes/updater.php:344
#, php-format
msgid "Last checked %s ago."
msgstr "Terakhir diperiksa %s yang lalu."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:37
msgid "Hide the WordPress version"
msgstr "Sembunyikan versi WordPress"

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:38
msgid ""
"Removes the generator tag from the pages and the feeds, so bots that look "
"for sites with an old version learn less about yours."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus tag generator dari halaman dan feed, sehingga bot yang mencari "
"situs dengan versi lama tahu lebih sedikit tentang situs Anda."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:42
msgid "Turn off the file editor"
msgstr "Matikan editor berkas"

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:43
msgid ""
"Removes the theme and plugin code editors from the dashboard. Someone who "
"gets into an account can not change your code from there."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus editor kode tema dan plugin dari dasbor. Orang yang berhasil masuk "
"ke sebuah akun tidak bisa mengubah kode Anda dari sana."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:47
msgid "Send safety headers"
msgstr "Kirim header keamanan"

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:48
msgid ""
"Asks browsers not to guess file types, not to show your pages inside frames "
"of other sites, and to share less of the address when a visitor leaves."
msgstr ""
"Meminta browser untuk tidak menebak jenis berkas, tidak menampilkan halaman "
"Anda di dalam bingkai situs lain, dan membagikan lebih sedikit alamat saat "
"pengunjung pergi."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:49
msgid "Other sites can no longer show your pages in a frame."
msgstr "Situs lain tidak bisa lagi menampilkan halaman Anda dalam bingkai."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:52
msgid "Give one message for a failed login"
msgstr "Beri satu pesan untuk login yang gagal"

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:53
msgid ""
"The login page no longer says whether the user name exists or the password "
"was wrong, so nobody can find out which user names are real."
msgstr ""
"Halaman login tidak lagi menyebutkan apakah nama pengguna ada atau kata "
"sandi salah, sehingga tidak ada yang bisa mencari tahu nama pengguna mana "
"yang asli."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:57
msgid "Hide the list of users from visitors"
msgstr "Sembunyikan daftar pengguna dari pengunjung"

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:58
msgid ""
"Visitors who are not logged in can not list user names through ?author=1, "
"the REST API or the sitemap. Author pages with the name in the address keep "
"working."
msgstr ""
"Pengunjung yang belum login tidak bisa melihat daftar nama pengguna lewat ?"
"author=1, REST API, atau peta situs. Halaman penulis dengan nama di "
"alamatnya tetap berfungsi."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:62
msgid "Turn off XML-RPC"
msgstr "Matikan XML-RPC"

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:63
msgid ""
"XML-RPC is an old way for apps to talk to WordPress, often used by bots to "
"guess passwords in bulk. Turning it off closes that door."
msgstr ""
"XML-RPC adalah cara lama bagi aplikasi untuk berbicara dengan WordPress, "
"sering dipakai bot untuk menebak kata sandi secara massal. Mematikannya "
"menutup pintu itu."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:64
msgid ""
"The WordPress mobile app, Jetpack and some publishing tools need it. Leave "
"it off if you use one of them."
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi seluler WordPress, Jetpack, dan beberapa alat penerbitan "
"membutuhkannya. Biarkan saklar ini mati jika Anda memakai salah satunya."

#: modules/shield/hardening.php:209
msgid "<strong>Error:</strong> The user name or the password is not right."
msgstr "<strong>Galat:</strong> Nama pengguna atau kata sandi tidak tepat."

#. translators: 1: installed version, 2: new version
#: modules/shield/health.php:257
msgid "WordPress is not up to date"
msgstr "WordPress belum terbaru"

#: modules/shield/health.php:257
#, php-format
msgid ""
"You have WordPress %1$s and %2$s is available. Updates close security holes "
"that are already known."
msgstr ""
"Anda memakai WordPress %1$s dan versi %2$s tersedia. Pembaruan menutup celah "
"keamanan yang sudah diketahui."

#: modules/shield/health.php:257
msgid "Update WordPress"
msgstr "Perbarui WordPress"

#. translators: %s: version
#: modules/shield/health.php:260
msgid "WordPress is up to date"
msgstr "WordPress sudah terbaru"

#: modules/shield/health.php:260
#, php-format
msgid "You have WordPress %s and no newer version is waiting."
msgstr "Anda memakai WordPress %s dan tidak ada versi yang lebih baru."

#. translators: %s: PHP version
#: modules/shield/health.php:266
#, php-format
msgid "Your server runs PHP %s."
msgstr "Server Anda memakai PHP %s."

#: modules/shield/health.php:268
msgid "PHP is no longer supported"
msgstr "PHP tidak lagi didukung"

#: modules/shield/health.php:268
msgid ""
"This version does not get security fixes any more. Ask your host to switch "
"to a newer PHP."
msgstr ""
"Versi ini tidak lagi mendapat perbaikan keamanan. Minta penyedia hosting "
"Anda beralih ke PHP yang lebih baru."

#: modules/shield/health.php:270
msgid "PHP will stop being supported soon"
msgstr "PHP akan segera tidak didukung"

#: modules/shield/health.php:270
msgid ""
"Its security fixes end within six months. Plan the switch to a newer PHP "
"with your host."
msgstr ""
"Perbaikan keamanannya berakhir dalam enam bulan. Rencanakan peralihan ke PHP "
"yang lebih baru bersama penyedia hosting Anda."

#: modules/shield/health.php:272
msgid "PHP is supported"
msgstr "PHP masih didukung"

#. translators: %s: names of plugins and themes
#: modules/shield/health.php:293
msgid "Plugins or themes are waiting for an update"
msgstr "Ada plugin atau tema yang menunggu pembaruan"

#: modules/shield/health.php:293
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Waiting: %s. An old plugin is the most common way a site is broken into."
msgstr ""
"Menunggu: %s. Plugin lama adalah cara yang paling sering dipakai untuk "
"membobol situs."

#: modules/shield/health.php:293
msgid "See the updates"
msgstr "Lihat pembaruan"

#: modules/shield/health.php:295
msgid "Plugins and themes are up to date"
msgstr "Plugin dan tema sudah terbaru"

#: modules/shield/health.php:295
msgid "None of them is waiting for an update."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang menunggu pembaruan."

#. translators: 1: number of plugins, 2: their names
#: modules/shield/health.php:305
msgid "Plugins are installed but not used"
msgstr "Ada plugin terpasang tetapi tidak dipakai"

#: modules/shield/health.php:305
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$d not used: %2$s. A plugin that is switched off can still be attacked if "
"it has a hole. Delete what you do not need."
msgstr ""
"%1$d tidak dipakai: %2$s. Plugin yang dimatikan tetap bisa diserang jika "
"punya celah. Hapus yang tidak Anda perlukan."

#: modules/shield/health.php:305
msgid "Open Plugins"
msgstr "Buka Plugin"

#: modules/shield/health.php:307
msgid "No unused plugins"
msgstr "Tidak ada plugin yang tidak dipakai"

#: modules/shield/health.php:307
msgid "Every installed plugin is in use."
msgstr "Semua plugin yang terpasang dipakai."

#: modules/shield/health.php:313
msgid "An administrator is called \"admin\""
msgstr "Ada administrator bernama \"admin\""

#: modules/shield/health.php:313
msgid ""
"Everybody tries this name first when guessing passwords. Make a new "
"administrator with another name, log in with it and delete the old one (give "
"its posts to the new one)."
msgstr ""
"Nama ini yang pertama dicoba semua orang saat menebak kata sandi. Buat "
"administrator baru dengan nama lain, login dengannya, lalu hapus yang lama "
"(berikan tulisannya ke yang baru)."

#: modules/shield/health.php:313 modules/shield/health.php:327
msgid "Open Users"
msgstr "Buka Pengguna"

#: modules/shield/health.php:315
msgid "No administrator is called \"admin\""
msgstr "Tidak ada administrator bernama \"admin\""

#: modules/shield/health.php:315
msgid "The most guessed user name is not an administrator here."
msgstr "Nama pengguna yang paling sering ditebak bukan administrator di sini."

#. translators: %d: number of administrators
#: modules/shield/health.php:327
msgid "Many administrators"
msgstr "Banyak administrator"

#: modules/shield/health.php:327
#, php-format
msgid ""
"There are %d administrators. Each one is a way in. Give people the lowest "
"role that lets them do their work."
msgstr ""
"Ada %d administrator. Masing-masing adalah jalan masuk. Beri orang peran "
"terendah yang cukup untuk pekerjaannya."

#. translators: %d: number of administrators
#: modules/shield/health.php:330
msgid "Few administrators"
msgstr "Administrator sedikit"

#: modules/shield/health.php:330
#, php-format
msgid "There are %d administrators."
msgstr "Ada %d administrator."

#. translators: %s: role name
#: modules/shield/health.php:337
msgid "Anyone can register as an editor or administrator"
msgstr "Siapa pun bisa mendaftar sebagai editor atau administrator"

#: modules/shield/health.php:337
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Registration is open and new people get the role \"%s\". Anyone could take "
"over your site. Close registration or change the role to Subscriber."
msgstr ""
"Pendaftaran terbuka dan orang baru mendapat peran \"%s\". Siapa pun bisa "
"mengambil alih situs Anda. Tutup pendaftaran atau ubah perannya menjadi "
"Pelanggan."

#: modules/shield/health.php:337 modules/shield/health.php:340
#: modules/shield/health.php:351
msgid "Open General settings"
msgstr "Buka Pengaturan Umum"

#. translators: %s: role name
#: modules/shield/health.php:340
msgid "Anyone can register and write"
msgstr "Siapa pun bisa mendaftar dan menulis"

#: modules/shield/health.php:340
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Registration is open and new people get the role \"%s\". Make it Subscriber "
"unless you really want strangers to write."
msgstr ""
"Pendaftaran terbuka dan orang baru mendapat peran \"%s\". Jadikan Pelanggan "
"kecuali Anda memang ingin orang asing menulis."

#: modules/shield/health.php:342
msgid "Registration is closed or harmless"
msgstr "Pendaftaran tertutup atau tidak berbahaya"

#: modules/shield/health.php:342
msgid "People can register, but only as subscribers."
msgstr "Orang bisa mendaftar, tetapi hanya sebagai pelanggan."

#: modules/shield/health.php:342
msgid "Nobody can register themselves."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang bisa mendaftar sendiri."

#: modules/shield/health.php:347
msgid "The site uses https"
msgstr "Situs memakai https"

#: modules/shield/health.php:347
msgid "Visitors and you talk to the site over a secure connection."
msgstr "Pengunjung dan Anda berhubungan dengan situs lewat sambungan aman."

#: modules/shield/health.php:349
msgid "https is not needed on this address"
msgstr "https tidak diperlukan pada alamat ini"

#: modules/shield/health.php:349
msgid "This is a local address (for tests)."
msgstr "Ini alamat lokal (untuk uji coba)."

#: modules/shield/health.php:351
msgid "The site does not use https"
msgstr "Situs tidak memakai https"

#: modules/shield/health.php:351
msgid ""
"Passwords and logins travel in the open. Ask your host for a certificate and "
"set both addresses in General settings to https."
msgstr ""
"Kata sandi dan login berjalan tanpa penyandian. Minta sertifikat ke penyedia "
"hosting Anda dan ubah kedua alamat di Pengaturan Umum menjadi https."

#: modules/shield/health.php:357
msgid "Errors are shown to visitors"
msgstr "Galat ditampilkan kepada pengunjung"

#: modules/shield/health.php:357
msgid ""
"Debug mode is on and shows PHP errors on the pages. They can reveal paths "
"and settings. Set WP_DEBUG to false in wp-config.php on a live site."
msgstr ""
"Mode debug menyala dan menampilkan galat PHP di halaman. Galat itu bisa "
"membuka lokasi berkas dan pengaturan. Setel WP_DEBUG ke false di wp-"
"config.php pada situs yang sudah tayang."

#: modules/shield/health.php:359
msgid "Debug mode is on"
msgstr "Mode debug menyala"

#: modules/shield/health.php:359
msgid ""
"Errors are not shown, but they are written to a log. Switch WP_DEBUG off on "
"a live site when you are done testing."
msgstr ""
"Galat tidak ditampilkan, tetapi dicatat ke log. Matikan WP_DEBUG pada situs "
"yang sudah tayang setelah selesai menguji."

#: modules/shield/health.php:361
msgid "Debug mode is off"
msgstr "Mode debug mati"

#: modules/shield/health.php:361
msgid "Nothing is written or shown for debugging."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang dicatat atau ditampilkan untuk debug."

#: modules/shield/health.php:368
msgid "wp-config.php can be changed by everyone"
msgstr "wp-config.php bisa diubah oleh semua orang"

#: modules/shield/health.php:368
msgid ""
"Anyone with an account on the server can read or change the file that holds "
"your database password. Set its permissions to 640 or 600."
msgstr ""
"Siapa pun yang punya akun di server bisa membaca atau mengubah berkas yang "
"menyimpan kata sandi database Anda. Setel izinnya ke 640 atau 600."

#: modules/shield/health.php:370
msgid "wp-config.php is protected"
msgstr "wp-config.php terlindungi"

#: modules/shield/health.php:370
msgid ""
"The file with the database password is not open to everyone on the server."
msgstr ""
"Berkas berisi kata sandi database tidak terbuka untuk semua orang di server."

#: modules/shield/health.php:382
msgid "The file editor is closed"
msgstr "Editor berkas tertutup"

#: modules/shield/health.php:382
msgid "Nobody can change theme or plugin code from the dashboard."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang bisa mengubah kode tema atau plugin dari dasbor."

#: modules/shield/health.php:384
msgid "The file editor is open"
msgstr "Editor berkas terbuka"

#: modules/shield/health.php:384
msgid ""
"Someone who gets into an administrator account can change your code from the "
"dashboard. Switch \"Turn off the file editor\" on."
msgstr ""
"Orang yang berhasil masuk ke akun administrator bisa mengubah kode Anda dari "
"dasbor. Nyalakan \"Matikan editor berkas\"."

#: modules/shield/health.php:384 modules/shield/health.php:389
msgid "Open the switches"
msgstr "Buka saklar"

#: modules/shield/health.php:387
msgid "Failed logins are limited"
msgstr "Login gagal dibatasi"

#: modules/shield/health.php:387
msgid "An address that fails to log in too often is locked for a while."
msgstr "Alamat yang terlalu sering gagal login dikunci untuk sementara."

#: modules/shield/health.php:389
msgid "Failed logins are not limited"
msgstr "Login gagal tidak dibatasi"

#: modules/shield/health.php:389
msgid "Bots can try passwords for ever. Switch \"Limit failed logins\" on."
msgstr ""
"Bot bisa mencoba kata sandi tanpa henti. Nyalakan \"Batasi login yang "
"gagal\"."

#. translators: %s: plugin names
#: modules/shield/health.php:394
msgid "A security plugin is active"
msgstr "Plugin keamanan aktif"

#: modules/shield/health.php:394
#, php-format
msgid "Active: %s."
msgstr "Aktif: %s."

#: modules/shield/health.php:396
msgid "No firewall or malware scanner found"
msgstr "Firewall atau pemindai malware tidak ditemukan"

#: modules/shield/health.php:396
msgid ""
"The switches here close common gaps, but they are not a firewall and not a "
"scanner. Add a plugin made for that, such as Wordfence, Solid Security or "
"Patchstack."
msgstr ""
"Saklar di sini menutup celah umum, tetapi bukan firewall dan bukan pemindai. "
"Tambahkan plugin yang dibuat untuk itu, seperti Wordfence, Solid Security, "
"atau Patchstack."

#: modules/shield/health.php:396 modules/shield/health.php:403
msgid "Find plugins"
msgstr "Cari plugin"

#. translators: %s: plugin names
#: modules/shield/health.php:401
msgid "A backup plugin is active"
msgstr "Plugin cadangan aktif"

#: modules/shield/health.php:401
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Active: %s. Check now and then that a recent backup exists and that you can "
"restore it."
msgstr ""
"Aktif: %s. Periksa sesekali bahwa ada cadangan terbaru dan Anda bisa "
"memulihkannya."

#: modules/shield/health.php:403
msgid "No backup plugin found"
msgstr "Plugin cadangan tidak ditemukan"

#: modules/shield/health.php:403
msgid ""
"If your host does not keep backups for you, one broken update or one attack "
"can cost you the whole site. Add a backup plugin, or ask your host."
msgstr ""
"Jika penyedia hosting Anda tidak menyimpan cadangan, satu pembaruan yang "
"rusak atau satu serangan bisa membuat Anda kehilangan seluruh situs. "
"Tambahkan plugin cadangan, atau tanyakan ke penyedia hosting Anda."

#. translators: 1: addresses, 2: how long ago
#: modules/shield/health.php:412
msgid "Files that should be secret can be opened"
msgstr "Berkas yang seharusnya rahasia bisa dibuka"

#: modules/shield/health.php:412
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Anyone can open: %1$s (checked %2$s ago). They can hold passwords or your "
"data. Remove them from the server or block them, then check again."
msgstr ""
"Siapa pun bisa membuka: %1$s (diperiksa %2$s yang lalu). Berkas itu bisa "
"berisi kata sandi atau data Anda. Hapus dari server atau blokir, lalu "
"periksa lagi."

#: modules/shield/health.php:414
msgid "The files could not be checked"
msgstr "Berkas tidak bisa diperiksa"

#: modules/shield/health.php:414
msgid ""
"The site could not ask its own address (some servers do not allow that). Try "
"again later."
msgstr ""
"Situs tidak bisa meminta alamatnya sendiri (beberapa server tidak "
"mengizinkannya). Coba lagi nanti."

#. translators: %s: how long ago
#: modules/shield/health.php:417
msgid "No secret files can be opened"
msgstr "Tidak ada berkas rahasia yang bisa dibuka"

#: modules/shield/health.php:417
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Common leftovers (.env, .git, copies of wp-config.php, debug.log, database "
"dumps, phpinfo, a folder listing) are not reachable (checked %s ago)."
msgstr ""
"Sisa-sisa yang umum (.env, .git, salinan wp-config.php, debug.log, dump "
"database, phpinfo, daftar isi folder) tidak bisa dijangkau (diperiksa %s "
"yang lalu)."

#. translators: 1: number needing attention, 2: number worth a look, 3: number fine
#: modules/shield/health.php:451
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d need attention, %2$d worth a look, %3$d fine."
